# Build-time ignore list for `new_app/license_manager/Dockerfile`.
#
# Docker reads `<Dockerfile>.dockerignore` from the Dockerfile's own directory,
# so this applies when the build context is `new_app/` (the context must contain
# `backend/`, which the API imports read-only).
#
# Keep the API image free of credentials, local state and anything client-side.

**/.git
**/.git/**
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/tests
**/logs
**/backups
**/data
**/.DS_Store
**/appsettings*.json
**/application_default_credentials.json
**/*service-account*.json
**/*-key*.json
!backend/app/licensing/verification_keys.json
!backend/customer_package.json
